diff --git a/NEWS.md b/NEWS.md
index 34a9e2d..067b12b 100644
--- a/NEWS.md
+++ b/NEWS.md
@@ -3,6 +3,14 @@ bubblewrap 0.13.2
 
 Released: ...
 
+Bug fixes:
+
+  * Improve compatibility with restrictive mount policies that reject
+    mount targets passed through /proc/self/fd. If `--tmpfs` needs the
+    descriptor-based retry after `ELOOP`, that mount is made `noexec`.
+  * If the initial root staging tmpfs mount returns `EPERM`, Bubblewrap
+    retries with `noexec`; files left on that staging root cannot be executed.
+
 bubblewrap 0.13.1
 =================
 
